OL,3,GNEWSAJames to headline Live From
OL,4,AWythenshawe Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames have been announced as the
OL,7,Fheadline act for next summer's Live
OL,8,FFrom Wythenshawe Park.
OL,10,FThe Manchester rockers will perform on
OL,11,FSunday 29 August with support from
OL,12,Findie bands The Charlatans and
OL,13,FRazorlight.
OL,15,FSince they formed in Whalley Range in
OL,16,F1982, James have gone on to release 18
OL,17,Fstudio albums and four top-10 singles
OL,18,Fwhich include tracks such as Sit Down,
OL,19,FLaid, Come Home, and She's A Star.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
